## confirm a stale preview
EntriesPage(BulkPreview(MarkReadPreview { query: EntryQuery { feed_id: None, read_filter: All, starred_filter: All, archive_filter: All, feed_ids: [], search_title: None, limit: None }, unread_entry_ids: [] }))
## reader load
ReaderPage(ApplyLoadedContent { entry_id: 1, content: ReaderPageLoadedContent { title: "Alpha one", body_text: "", body_html: Some("<p>Body of Alpha one</p>"), source: "Feed A", author: None, original_url: Some("https://example.invalid/a1"), published_at: "<time>", navigation_state: EntryNavigation { previous_unread_entry_id: None, next_unread_entry_id: None, previous_feed_entry_id: Some(2), next_feed_entry_id: None }, is_read: true, is_starred: false } })
