ReaderPage(SetError { entry_id: 999, error: Some("文章不存在") })
## reader toggle read
ReaderPage(SetStatus { message: "已将当前文章标记为未读。", tone: "info" })
ReaderPage(PatchEntryFlags { entry_id: 1, is_read: Some(false), is_starred: None })
## reader toggle starred by shortcut
ReaderPage(SetStatus { message: "已通过快捷键收藏文章。", tone: "info" })
ReaderPage(PatchEntryFlags { entry_id: 1, is_read: None, is_starred: Some(true) })
## reader localize assets
